    {
      "id": "a7b4cbe5-cf11-42a4-a957-25c83386f805",
      "title": "Escute e acompanhe a frase em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "6c9e46a3-a27d-4b5e-9199-6311fafd3adf",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e leia a frase.</p><p><strong>dos tomates</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>dois tomates</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b6073965b87248138633a21691788d9f_b01-compras-y-cantidades.png?Expires=1794099491&Signature=tMHD3tgzixSbBkkRHkON9MQDSOxd4nuIUAIlW6pG1XjIguphAbADmhZOLdxzbqSh9r4iRHDbKGn6sDOSWLFuyjli9FC0S1hTcxWVO09QWHFzkFOOuqwhT5xvBbRmRkA5mPtka-X9CzMHeTMp6FQbExtWcFbccmCAbNc0-y7mVYue~ASxChmqtz9fE6eC8HO0dnqdQE60264RxDrauKIq6NZcVEniXDC5N~o-neSYKSxgszfoa1Q0NO-ynbVvnjJNEo8FXaAdntTTcvGkSDMqkrw0IXzinaCOAyugMf3YGFPUemT3IGtrzhjCJ6UMofiY5LuE-Qd5G0syn0WgYIqq9A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/0f48dfdf496742aeb852e2148623eb63_b02-dos-tomates.mp3?Expires=1794099491&Signature=N1w6EUG-YK7OChGkgIS6b4KfAZFcGyHf5t3RHiLChloBYoQwuSD3OdqlNocWb-ZrT4jgTQ5A6VmWmJe9BR27GzFCdaYRSsrT~gKQ9RulqvXh8QhpIx3272LC0KZberbSHRAsDVE4q8eNrQ4pKkN7bioHP3lYPWUgkcp5hb~trbt~DWoYkbQYKiJGj1MWWnjnc3PgpylH-A9CCumwA95fEPxk2FqR9DLKvcw6O5pWTjXETOvF3AkMB~a~RZTXuUmomN~ghUAlcFHnJsAS0XesogcRQnCRZ-teClHytFLRph9GpdqJJDRvRQU25~4YW~4kyW1m3OLFnXCmdIIUi0jQLg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
