    {
      "id": "8ad443ed-6af5-4fc0-9892-106e06913d09",
      "title": "Leia a observação curta e repare em como o número entra na frase.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1f427051-4150-428c-b383-dd166b64e8e9",
          "textContent": "<p>Com <strong>tomates</strong>, o normal é pensar em unidades separadas.</p><p>Por isso, você pode contar: <strong>un tomate</strong>, <strong>dos tomates</strong>, <strong>tres tomates</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "6f98bab6-e3aa-41f2-bf99-5e102aa2ff0c",
      "title": "Escute e acompanhe a frase em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "83f10862-efab-494c-8aaf-cdb679639807",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e leia a frase.</p><p><strong>un paquete de arroz</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>um pacote de arroz</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b6073965b87248138633a21691788d9f_b01-compras-y-cantidades.png?Expires=1794099491&Signature=tMHD3tgzixSbBkkRHkON9MQDSOxd4nuIUAIlW6pG1XjIguphAbADmhZOLdxzbqSh9r4iRHDbKGn6sDOSWLFuyjli9FC0S1hTcxWVO09QWHFzkFOOuqwhT5xvBbRmRkA5mPtka-X9CzMHeTMp6FQbExtWcFbccmCAbNc0-y7mVYue~ASxChmqtz9fE6eC8HO0dnqdQE60264RxDrauKIq6NZcVEniXDC5N~o-neSYKSxgszfoa1Q0NO-ynbVvnjJNEo8FXaAdntTTcvGkSDMqkrw0IXzinaCOAyugMf3YGFPUemT3IGtrzhjCJ6UMofiY5LuE-Qd5G0syn0WgYIqq9A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/d48ff9dae3bf40358853ef772d860f10_b04-un-paquete-de-arroz.mp3?Expires=1794099491&Signature=FQ1lZh9BiPNjw7pUGk~Wmdqx2FGxc7FI5Kzy2hJaQEhWFQJ9-cANitjO8wzHodngp~vJ07oPezL9YkdOX~~unsLGaSoB-cqYbP7wW-AXVezDFAQ7hUHXt6yxN0FX6qMO~pfgRxQTMumXQjMt08De1SepfGt8itHaGAivBu0mZ7XQEDkMOHvO9oc3eN1~BkSYMwuztY5X7-G6mU9hrYzCvgBvpmyUb04il4RMsSPPgoL8RvuEy2ArtVM2s7VkWQgxXXyzF~xwGJ5ClI0McgQZXzkebn26IVxhaDqpS0YVgAONka2GjxF0wH7-Pm4CVp-S~eyf8Vt~IwzmgdZ9j3sLqw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
